COMPILATION OF: E46L14

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L14 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 6, AUTO STORAGE 2 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 K FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L14

   1 a 0000 E46L14:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2a] runtime 3: FIXED BIN(15).  k = 42 is 28 in DR's octal print (the E3B2
   4 a 0006      measurement), and the 9-wide numeric edit right-justifies it, so the file must hold
   5 a 0006      seven spaces then '34'. */
   6 c 0006   dcl outf file, k fixed bin(15);
   7 c 0006   k = 42;
   8 c 000C   open file(outf) stream output title('L14OUT DAT');
   9 c 0029   put file(outf) list(k);
  10 c 0043   close file(outf);
  11 c 0049   put list('DONE');
  12 c 0060   stop;
  13 a 0063 end E46L14;

CODE SIZE = 0063
DATA AREA = 0010
FREE SYMS = 387D
END  COMPILATION
